  Version 0.49.0
  (2026-08-01) continues the v3 backfill with Academy of Management Journal
  volume 64 issue 1 and volume 63 issue 6 — 25 notes, all v2 augmentations.
  A backfill adds no papers, so the record total remains 1,167; the version-tier
  census shifts to 61 v1, 709 v2, and 397 v3 notes. All 25 augmentation deltas
  passed the validator and mechanical diff-guard on the first attempt. Each
  touched note passed a fresh full independent 9-field rubric-v2 audit, with a
  final 225 of 225 prose-field verdicts SUPPORTED and no residual PARTIAL,
  after five evidence-based legacy-field repairs across four notes in two
