  Version 0.48.0
  (2026-08-01) continues the v3 backfill with Academy of Management Journal
  volume 64 issue 3 and volume 64 issue 2 — 25 notes, all v2 augmentations.
  A backfill adds no papers, so the record total is unchanged at 1,167; the
  version-tier census shifts to 61 v1, 734 v2, and 372 v3 notes. The upgrade
  phase was the cleanest of the backfill so far: all 25 augmentations passed
  the validator and the mechanical diff-guard on the first attempt, with zero
  self-fix cycles. Each touched note passed a fresh full independent 9-field
  rubric-v2 audit, and this is the first batch of the backfill to finish
  spotless — 225 of 225 prose-field verdicts SUPPORTED, with no residual PARTIAL
  accepted — after nineteen evidence-based repairs across ten notes in three
  repair rounds and four audit rounds. Six of the thirteen round-1 PARTIALs were
  the no-practice-section scope drift characteristic of this 2021 cohort, in
